    "group": "Carnival of Excess",
    "summary": "A unit of yours is Empowered while either applies:\n\n- It is an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** unit within 6\" of a friendly **LEGIONS OF EXCESS** unit.\n- It is a **LEGIONS OF EXCESS** unit within 6\" of a friendly **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** unit.\n\nWeapons on models in an Empowered unit have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**. For a weapon that already has it, unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ score Critical Hits.",
